1
00:00:05,175 --> 00:00:10,000
《Favourite Daughter》

2
00:00:12,254 --> 00:00:14,271
I was a singer

3
00:00:14,571 --> 00:00:16,696
You were my fan

4
00:00:17,188 --> 00:00:20,488
When no one gave a damn

5
00:00:20,888 --> 00:00:24,313
It was you in the dark

6
00:00:25,988 --> 00:00:28,588
Scared of your anger

7
00:00:28,588 --> 00:00:31,225
In love with your whim

8
00:00:31,225 --> 00:00:33,875
Some notes I don't hit

9
00:00:34,875 --> 00:00:38,375
But I don't give up

10
00:00:39,925 --> 00:00:41,725
Now every day

11
00:00:41,725 --> 00:00:44,050
the plane takes off

12
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:47,825
And every night, the room fills up with

13
00:00:47,825 --> 00:00:51,050
People who are convinced I'm not

14
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:55,875
Just some kid fakin' it for your love

15
00:00:56,625 --> 00:00:58,072
'Cause I'm an actress

16
00:00:58,072 --> 00:01:02,250
all of the medals I won for ya

17
00:01:03,325 --> 00:01:09,475
Breaking my back just to be your favourite daughter

18
00:01:09,475 --> 00:01:13,400
Everywhere I run

19
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,175
 I'm always runnin' to ya

20
00:01:17,625 --> 00:01:23,500
Breaking my back just hoping you'll say I'm a star

21
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:28,325
You had a brother, I look like him

22
00:01:28,325 --> 00:01:32,300
You told us as kids

23
00:01:33,025 --> 00:01:36,800
"He diеd of a broken heart"

24
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:41,475
And for evеry door you open

25
00:01:41,725 --> 00:01:43,725
There's a room I can't go in

26
00:01:43,725 --> 00:01:49,150
I break in, I still can't find you

27
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:55,100
Now that every day, the plane takes off

28
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:58,625
And every night the room fills up

29
00:01:58,625 --> 00:02:02,475
I tell myself that soon we'll talk

30
00:02:02,475 --> 00:02:07,100
Then I sing every word just to ya

31
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:14,100
'Cause I'm an actress, all of the medals I won for ya

32
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:20,975
Panic attack just to be your favourite daughter

33
00:02:20,975 --> 00:02:28,625
Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya

34
00:02:28,875 --> 00:02:34,000
Breaking my back to carry the weight of your heart

35
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,775
But I keep dancing till I get sick

36
00:02:37,775 --> 00:02:41,325
Why'd you have to dream so big?

37
00:02:41,325 --> 00:02:49,450
Why did no one listen when you hit the notes from your heart?

38
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:55,325
Ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah

39
00:02:55,625 --> 00:03:02,175
I'm a good actress, look at the medals I won for ya

40
00:03:02,175 --> 00:03:08,750
So you could imagine being a favourite daughter

41
00:03:08,750 --> 00:03:16,400
Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya

42
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:22,950
Breaking my back just to be as brave as my mother

